@base = http://localhost:8000
@dataset = tmdb:first-import-v1
@person = replace-with-a-returned-person-uuid

### Change base to your API_PORT. Optional VS Code REST Client requests.
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Published datasets
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/datasets?limit=20

### Eligible movies
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/{{dataset}}/movies?limit=5

### Directors
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/{{dataset}}/people?role=director&limit=5

### Actual person's directing credits (replace person above)
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/{{dataset}}/people/{{person}}/films?role=director&limit=5
